<title>HONG KONG: Soosan Heavy unit sets US$30 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Soosan Heavy unit sets US$30 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debut floating rate note issue for Soosan Hong Kong was announced by arranger Korea First Finance on Friday.</p>
<p> BORROWER    SOOSAN HONG KONG LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR   SOOSAN HEAVY INDUSTRIES CO LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT	US$30 MLN  COUPON     6ML+125   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCHED  11.JAN.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  YR 2	 CALLS	YR 2	REPLIES   24.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING     LUXEMBOURG REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATING	NONE	 SALE LMTS  US/UK/SING/HK/S.KOREA</p>
<p> NEG PLG     YES	  CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   S.KOREA    GOV LAW    ENGLISH   PAY DATE  10.FEB.97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS	US$3 MLN+   100BP  ALL-IN  175</p>
<p>   MANAGERS		  US$1-2 MLN   98BP  ALL-IN  174</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  KDB ASIA, KEXIM ASIA, KOREA FIRST FINANCE AND LTCB</p>
<p>		ASIA.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
